================================================================================
SCOPE
================================================================================

The MIT license above covers the source code, stylesheets and documentation
authored for this project, namely:

  - claude/skin.json
  - claude/skin.css           (generated by scripts/gen-skin-css.py)
  - claude/patches.css
  - scripts/gen-skin-css.py
  - scripts/validate-skin.mjs
  - brand-plugin/             (when present)
  - README.md, README.en.md, INSTALL.md, scripts/README.md

It does NOT cover the items in the two sections below.

================================================================================
CLAWD MASCOT — PIXEL GEOMETRY PROVENANCE
================================================================================

Clawd, the pixel crab, is Anthropic's mascot for Claude Code. Anthropic and
Claude are trademarks of Anthropic PBC; this project is an unofficial fan
tribute with no affiliation or endorsement.

The crab in this project is pure CSS: box-shadow pixel art, no image file of
the mascot is redistributed anywhere.

The pixel frame data lives in crab-plugin/lib/client.js, which embeds it so the
plugin works standalone. The skin keeps only the small greeting sparkle in
claude/crab.generated.css.

The pixel geometry was derived from the SillyTavern extension "Claude Web 2.0"
by lulu (github.com/claudenoshujin/claude-web), distributed freely in the
类脑 community. Credit for the original pixel artwork belongs to that author.
This project reproduces the geometry only — all selectors, keyframes, colour
mapping and placement are original to this project, and no file from that
repository is copied.

This project is likewise released freely. If you redistribute it, keep this
attribution intact.

================================================================================
VENDORED FONTS — SIL OPEN FONT LICENSE 1.1
================================================================================

This project redistributes four font binaries under claude/assets/fonts/.
They are latin-subset builds of open-source typefaces and are NOT covered by
the MIT license above. Each is licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1, which permits redistribution and bundling provided the fonts are
not sold by themselves and any derivative keeps the reserved font names
intact:

  - Newsreader        (newsreader-normal.woff2, newsreader-italic.woff2)
  - Inter             (inter-normal.woff2)
  - JetBrains Mono    (jetbrains-mono-normal.woff2)

Full license text: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL
Per-family copyright notices and license files:
  - Newsreader:     https://github.com/productiontype/Newsreader
  - Inter:          https://github.com/rsms/inter
  - JetBrains Mono: https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono

The files were fetched as latin subsets from Google Fonts by
claude/assets/fonts/build-fonts.sh.

================================================================================
TRADEMARKS AND THIRD-PARTY TYPE
================================================================================

"Claude" and "Anthropic" are trademarks of Anthropic PBC.

This project is an unofficial, non-commercial fan tribute to the claude.ai
interface. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Anthropic
PBC. Anthropic's logo, wordmark and brand assets are the property of Anthropic
PBC and are not licensed for redistribution here. No trademark rights are
granted by this license; if you fork or redistribute this project, you are
responsible for how you use those marks.

Anthropic's actual typefaces, Copernicus and StyreneB, are licensed commercial
fonts. They are NOT included in this repository and MUST NOT be added to it.
This project substitutes the open-licensed Newsreader (in Copernicus's serif
role) and Inter (in StyreneB's sans-serif role) in their place.
